From 9431595fa9ac3500e6d407c7d45a1f3744fe0e86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gareth Andrew <gingerhendrix@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:34:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] wasm: pack the dom and webworker libs in a stream of
 their own

---
 crates/ts_goport/parts/goport_util/build.rs   | 58 ++++++++++++-----
 .../ts_goport/src/frontend/bundled/embed.rs   | 64 ++++++++++++-------
